# NOTE: .humanize/ is intentionally tracked per user policy (2026-05-16).
# Do NOT add .humanize/ to this gitignore — the user wants planning
# artifacts, RLCR rounds, bitlesson, and skill outputs all in version
# control. The humanize plugin's stop hook may complain; that is a known
# policy conflict; do not silently resolve it by re-untracking.

